Write a Jest test suite using beforeEach to build a shared fixture object used by several tests of a NotesApp class.

class NotesApp {
  constructor() { this.notes = []; }
  add(text) { this.notes.push({ id: this.notes.length + 1, text }); }
  list() { return [...this.notes]; }
}

output:
